{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core of Magic is set in a high fantasy world where you play as a Mage, killing monsters, collecting loot, and solving quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The game world is exists of leveling hubs where you can wait for monsters to spawn, but there is      also a small overall world where you can do quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The game world consists of 3 act's that become available to you as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>How many quests are there? and what futures?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 13 main quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 11 side quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 3 Uber quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- the game has more then 200 items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- You can find normal white type, blue Magic type and unique\u00a0type  items in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\u00a03 difficulty settings Normal, Nightmare, Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Note: There are no microtransaction in the game despite it being Free to play</strong></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644210?t=1749503214","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644210?t=1749503214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644210/c26b93865d55e39ff80e00dc40c2348d8c75350b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749503214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644210/c26b93865d55e39ff80e00dc40c2348d8c75350b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749503214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core of Magic is set in a high fantasy world where you play as a Mage, killing monsters, collecting loot, and solving quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The game world